<%# Fuime's brand guidelines.

    This page previously served Hack Club's: it told founders to describe
    themselves as "fiscally sponsored by The Hack Foundation (d.b.a. Hack Club),
    EIN 81-2908499", offered Hack Club's logo files as "Our Logos", and called
    Fuime "a fiscal sponsorship platform backed by Column". None of that is
    Fuime — see CLAUDE.md Rule 7 (their trademarks leave our UI) and L5/L8
    (never describe a product we do not have, never imply we are a bank). %>
<% content_for :title, "Brand Guidelines" %>

<div class="overview">
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>
    These are the rules for writing about Fuime and using the Fuime mark — on your
    storefront, your socials, a school fair flyer, or anywhere else you tell people
    what you're running your business on.
  </p>
  <p>
    Getting this right protects you as much as us. Describing the relationship
    accurately is what keeps a customer, a parent, or a teacher from thinking your
    business is something it isn't.
  </p>
</div>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2>Our Name</h2>
  <p>When using our name, please make sure to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Write it <strong>Fuime</strong> — capital F, lowercase the rest. Not FUIME, not fuime.</li>
    <li>Refrain from adding or removing characters and words (e.g. "Fuime Bank", "Fuime Inc").</li>
    <li>Never pair it with another company's name in a way that implies a partnership.</li>
  </ul>

  <%= render "application/callout", type: "warning", title: "Fuime is not a bank — and neither is your venture" do %>
    <ul>
      <li>Fuime is a financial technology company, not a bank.</li>
      <li>
        Never describe what you have as a bank account, checking, savings, deposits,
        or as insured or FDIC-backed. It is a <strong>payment account</strong>, opened
        and owned by your parent or guardian.
      </li>
      <li>
        Payments are processed and funds are held by Stripe. Fuime never takes custody
        of your money.
      </li>
    </ul>
  <% end %>

  <%= render "application/callout", type: "info", title: "In legal or formal settings, use:" do %>
    <ul>
      <li>"<%= @event_name %> uses Fuime for payments and bookkeeping."</li>
      <li>
        "<%= @event_name %>'s payment account is opened and owned by a parent or guardian
        through Fuime."
      </li>
    </ul>
  <% end %>
</section>

<section class="mb-8" id="describing-fuime">
  <h2>Describing Fuime</h2>
  <p>
    If you need a sentence for a website, a listing, or a school form, use this one:
  </p>
  <code>
    <%= @event_name %> runs on Fuime, a financial platform for teen-run businesses. The
    account is opened and owned by a parent or guardian. Fuime is a financial technology
    company, not a bank.
  </code>

  <%= render "application/callout", type: "error", title: "Never say any of these" do %>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>"Fiscally sponsored by Fuime"</strong> — Fuime is not a fiscal sponsor.</li>
      <li><strong>"A 501(c)(3)" / "tax-deductible"</strong> — Fuime is not a charity, and money sent to your business is not a deductible donation.</li>
      <li><strong>"Fuime is my bank"</strong> — see above. This one can get us both in real trouble.</li>
      <li><strong>"Backed by Hack Club"</strong> — Fuime is an independent product. See <%= link_to "attribution", "#attribution", style: "color: inherit;" %>.</li>
    </ul>
  <% end %>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2>Our Logo</h2>
  <p>
    The Fuime mark is an arch monogram. Use it as-is: don't recolour it, rotate it,
    add effects, or rebuild it.
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid--wide grid--spacious mt3 mb3 md-mb4">
    <% @marks.each do |mark| %>
      <div class="card w-100 pb0">
        <div class="card__banner card__banner--top center bg-<%= mark[:background] %>" aria-label="<%= mark[:criteria] %>">
          <img src="<%= mark[:svg] %>" height="80" alt="<%= mark[:name] %>" style="max-width: 100%;">
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb0"><%= mark[:name] %></h3>
        <p class="mt0 muted"><%= mark[:criteria] %></p>
        <div class="card__banner card__banner--bottom card__darker mb0">
          <%= link_to "SVG", mark[:svg], class: "btn bg-info mr2 w-auto", target: :_blank, download: "" %>
          <%= link_to "PNG", mark[:png], class: "btn bg-accent", target: :_blank, download: "" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>

  <% logo_usage_callout_title = capture do %>
    By downloading or using the Fuime mark, you agree to abide by the
    <%= link_to "general usage rules", "#general-usage-rules", style: "color: inherit;" %>.
  <% end %>
  <%= render "application/callout", type: "info", title: logo_usage_callout_title %>
</section>

<section class="mb-8" id="general-usage-rules">
  <h2>General Usage Rules</h2>
  <div class="grid grid--wide grid--spacious mt2 mb3 md-mb4">
    <div class="card w-100 pb2 callout--success">
      <h2 class="mt-0"><span class="inline-block w-8">✅</span>Do</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 pl-8">
        <li>Use the Fuime mark to link to Fuime's home page.</li>
        <li>Use the Fuime mark to link to your own venture's storefront on Fuime.</li>
        <li>Use the Fuime mark to show that your business takes payments through Fuime.</li>
        <li>Use the Fuime name in blog posts, news articles, or social posts about Fuime.</li>
        <li>Say "we use Fuime" or "powered by Fuime" on your storefront or socials.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card w-100 pb2 callout--error">
      <h2 class="mt-0"><span class="inline-block w-8">🚫</span>Don't</h2>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 pl-8">
        <li>Use the Fuime mark or name in a way that implies Fuime endorses, owns, or vouches for your business.</li>
        <li>Use the Fuime mark as your own business's logo, or build it into one.</li>
        <li>Sell Fuime artwork, or merchandise carrying the Fuime mark, without our written permission.</li>
        <li>Change the mark's aspect ratio. Resize it proportionally or not at all.</li>
        <li>Recolour the mark, outline it, add shadows or gradients, or place it on a busy photo.</li>
        <li>Crowd it. Leave clear space on every side of at least half the mark's height.</li>
        <li>Display the mark below 24px tall, where its inner detail stops resolving.</li>
        <li>Imply Fuime is a bank, a charity, a fiscal sponsor, or your legal guardian.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% help_callout_title = capture do %>
    For other uses of the Fuime brand, or to request permission for anything above,
    <%= link_to "contact the Fuime team", "mailto:support@fuime.com", style: "color: inherit;" %>.
  <% end %>
  <%= render "application/callout", type: "info", title: help_callout_title %>
</section>

<section class="mb-8" id="attribution">
  <h2>Attribution</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Fuime is a fork of
    <%= link_to "HCB", "https://github.com/hackclub/hcb", target: "_blank" %>
    by Hack Club, used under the AGPL-3.0. Fuime is an independent product: it is not
    affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by Hack Club or The Hack Foundation, and
    it is not a fiscal sponsor or a 501(c)(3).
  </p>
</section>
